WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.330
- Also there is some sad news.

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.050
I know that you were
really close with Betty.

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.790
And I know that you worked
with her in "Hot in Cleveland",

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:08.490
and so do you remember the
first time you met her?

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:11.740
- The first time I met
her was at the reading,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.370
the very first script reading
for "Hot in Cleveland".

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.933
And I was in awe.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.870
You've met Betty.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.560
- I actually never met Betty.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.770
No.
- I can't believe that.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:21.603
- I never met Betty White.

00:00:21.603 --> 00:00:22.436
No.
- Oh my God.

00:00:22.436 --> 00:00:23.269
- I know.

00:00:23.269 --> 00:00:25.070
And I'm such a huge fan, but yeah.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:28.830
- When you're in her
presence, she literally glows.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.660
I'm telling you, I don't know how,

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.900
but the woman is just
a walking glow stick.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.630
Like she's just full of
gratitude and love and kindness.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:38.740
She was just the greatest gift.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.230
- When you've been in
the industry for so long.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:41.063
And then you,

00:00:41.063 --> 00:00:43.020
so y'all just met on "Hot in Cleveland"?

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.110
- Yeah, back (stammers)
- Were you still floored?

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:46.300
- Oh my God, yes.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.645
I mean, Betty's been amazing for 99 years.

00:00:49.645 --> 00:00:50.478
(interviewee laughs)

00:00:50.478 --> 00:00:52.240
- I know, I was so mad.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.480
'Cause I was like really?

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.320
Just shy of a hundred.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.730
That was-
- But that's Betty.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.500
Betty's got the best timing.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.310
Why not send 2021 out with a bang?

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.150
Say see you later.

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:03.180
- Yeah.
- I'm out.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:06.193
- She's like peace.
(both laugh)

